It's a need, a compulsion o' my little brothers and sisters - a need to create, to build, to give something to the world, something new and unique that only you can give.

A malenky little part of you, a tangible manifestation of how you think and analyse the world around you. You are what you produce and what you produce will define how you are remembered.

